# ─── Legacy install trees & vendor reference material ───
# Archived VIT installations and vendor reference PDFs (e.g. Koh Young
# K-Smart programming guide) live in the workspace so the AI assistant and
# developers can inspect raw JSPs, XML config, JAR manifests, PDFs, etc.,
# but they are NOT versioned. Distilled facts get versioned via
# .github/copilot-instructions.md, .github/skills/*/SKILL.md, and pdf_text/.
VIT_Vieweb/
VIT_Sigmalink/
Ksmart/

# ─── Python (for extract_pdfs.py / extract_sigmalink_pdfs.py) ───
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ─── Node / front-end (future Nieweb work) ───
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.parcel-cache/
.next/
.nuxt/
.turbo/
.svelte-kit/

# ─── JVM / build outputs (future Nieweb work) ───
target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
.gradle/
!.gradle-wrapper.jar

# ─── .NET build outputs ───
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
TestResults/
[Nn]ieweb.slnx.tmp

# ─── IDE & OS noise ───
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── Logs & scratch ───
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# ─── Secrets (NEVER commit) ───
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
credentials.*
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json

# ─── Local dev databases ───
# SQLite dev/design-time DBs live in the workspace but are never tracked.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
